WEBVTT

36:30.757 --> 36:32.633
(BLADE CLANGING)

36:32.759 --> 36:34.802
- (HORSE NEIGHS)
- You dare!

36:34.927 --> 36:38.222
You give commands to me? To me?

36:40.183 --> 36:43.811
You do not command the dragon.
I am Lord of the Seven Kingdoms.

36:43.936 --> 36:48.691
I don't take orders from savages
or their sluts. Do you hear me?

36:51.652 --> 36:54.030
(SPEAKS DOTHRAKI)

36:54.155 --> 36:56.741
- (VISERYS GASPING)
- Rakharo ask if you want him dead, Khaleesi.

36:56.866 --> 36:58.367
No.

36:58.493 --> 37:01.746
(SPEAKS DOTHRAKI)
